'''Shen''' is an [[NPC]] running both [[Shen's Auction]] and its [[Barrier Street|Rift version]]. It is unclear if he has traveled to the [[Rift Dimension]] or only his counterparts.

There are {{Green|5}} '''Shens''' in the {{zone|Cerebral Citadel}}:
*{{NPCSprite|Shen Chaos}}
*{{NPCSprite|Shen Albedo}}
*{{NPCSprite|Shen Citrinitas}}
*{{NPCSprite|Shen Rubedo}}
*{{NPCSprite|Shen Magnum Opus}}

== Lore ==
*According to {{NPCSprite|Damia (Rift);Damia}}, one of the constants in each universe is that '''Shen''' is the richest person.
*According to {{NPCSprite|Elise (Rift);Elise}}, Wizards believe that '''Shen''' employed or created {{NPCSprite|Dante}}.
**Additionally from her dialogue, she suggests the idea that '''Shen''' may have discovered a way in the [[Rift Dimension]] before the wizards and found {{NPCSprite|Dante}}.
*According to the {{NPCSprite|Goon}}s while {{NPCSprite|Candidate Aura;Aura}} was mayor, both {{NPCSprite|Aura}} and {{NPCSprite|Dante}} were part of '''Shen's''' team and left, with {{NPCSprite|Dante}} leaving first and {{NPCSprite|Aura}} following after.

== Trivia ==
*'''Shen''' could be associated with wizards due to [[Shen's Auction]] selling the {{Item|Wizard Wand}}, which is said to be a private joke amongst Wizards.

